Package: com.borisb.simprobe
Name: SIM Probe
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Description: Visual probe of SIM / mobile-network info, labelled by the access tier a normal sandboxed app would have (public CoreTelephony vs root CommCenter). On-device privacy research.
